{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Turnos 是一款專為輪班工作者而設的排班日曆應用程式，護士、機師、酒店員工、工廠員工或醫護人員等以輪班方式工作的人士，只需輸入一次輪班週期，即可自動推算未來班表。無論早班、午班、夜班或自訂時間，都能在同一個地方整理清楚。原價 US $5.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自動推算輪班與收入估算</h2>\n<p>設定好早班、午班、夜班或自訂時間的輪班週期後，Turnos 會自動計算未來班表。主畫面顯示今日班次的開始、結束與剩餘時間，日曆則呈現整個月的安排，並統計總工時與班別分佈。加班、早退、休假與病假都可直接標記調整，設定各類班別時薪後更可估算每月收入。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-32.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Turnos Shift Rotation Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T18:18:21.047078+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}